{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_a8268b2e31604e6781dd950862e3eff5","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_da348189e82c6d871ea166c3aeea220bba0ab26e0974ddd3ba249d3b87364a3a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"sa4hnd/vibra-code@0a8524a68899 snapshot 1b89e3adc0f154c1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_46d3e680f887f64bf1aba25cec3df3ce0fa32b6ac5338db8859ad1fd796d57be"],"source_ids":["src_98f0d367e9995225afb58cb97dfddc81"],"text":"The architecture diagram shows three tiers: an Expo iOS app talking over an API to a Next.js + Convex server, which queues work via Inngest to an E2B sandbox running the AI agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a8268b2e31604e6781dd950862e3eff5"}
